SUMMARY:🌳🚶‍♂️ UNIONVILLE TRAIL HIKE & HISTORIC MAIN STREET! 
 🚶‍♀️🌳
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🌳
 🚶‍♂️ UNIONVILLE TRAIL HIKE & HISTORIC MAIN STREET! 🚶‍♀️
 🌳\n\n**Forest Trails\, Small-Town Charm & One of the GTA's Most Beautif
 ul Villages**\n\nNeed a break from the city without travelling too far?\nJ
 oin us for a day exploring **Unionville**\, one of the GTA's most charming
  and picturesque communities.\n\nWe'll spend the day enjoying peaceful for
 est trails\, walking along the Rouge River\, and finishing back at the\nhi
 storic Main Street\, where beautifully preserved heritage buildings\, caf
 és\, boutiques\, and tree-lined streets make it feel like you've stepped 
 into another era.\n\nIt's the perfect mix of nature\, history\, and great 
 conversation.\nThis isn't a race or a difficult hike—it's a relaxed soci
 al day outdoors where the journey is just as important as the destination.
 \n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.wh
 atsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)🚶‍♂️\n\n**What We'll Do**\n\nWe
 'll travel together to Unionville before beginning our hike through the be
 autiful trail system that winds through forests\, meadows\, and along the 
 Rouge River.\nThe trails are peaceful\, well-maintained\, and offer a wond
 erful escape from the city while still being close to Toronto.\n\nAlong th
 e way we'll stop in a scenic park for about **30 minutes** to enjoy lunch 
 together\, so bring something to eat—and if you'd like\, something small
  to share with the group.\n\nAfter our hike\, those that want to stay back
  an exploring **Historic Unionville Main Street**\, one of the most beauti
 ful heritage districts in Ontario. Filled with charming shops\, cafés\, a
 nd beautifully restored buildings dating back to the 1800s\, it's easy to 
 see why Unionville has been featured in so many movies and television prod
 uctions.\n\nExpect a full day of walking\, fresh air\, and plenty of oppor
 tunities to meet new people.\n\n***\n\n## 🌦️ Weather & Expectations\n
 \nThis event happens rain or shine.\nThe trails are easy to moderate\, but
  please come prepared for several hours of walking.\nComfortable walking s
 hoes are highly recommended.\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n### 🚆 
 Meetup Location #1 (GO Transit)\n\n📍 Outside the **Fairmont Royal York 
 Hotel**\n**PLEASE NOTE -** This is the ONLY Meetup spot where we will bein
 g meeting people at this location.\n🫎 I'll be wearing my **Moose Hat**\
 n⏰ **9:30 AM**\nWe will leave at **9:45 AM sharp** to catch our train.\n
 If you miss us\, unfortunately you won't be able to join the group.\n**GO 
 Transit Cost:** $10 Go Pass - [CLICK HERE TO GET IT](https://www.gotransit
 .com/en/partners-and-promotions/weekend-passes-with-go) (one week before)\
 n\n### 🚗 Meetup Location #2 (Drivers)\n\n📍 Outside the **Starbucks i
 n Unionville**\n⏰ **11:15 AM**\nWe will wait until **11:20 AM** before b
 eginning the hike.\n**[CLICK HERE](google.com/maps/place/old+unionville+st
 arbucks/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x89d4d5c824f03db7:0x6801054f8397d225?sa=X&ved=1t:
 242&ictx=111)**[ ](google.com/maps/place/old+unionville+starbucks/data=!4m
 2!3m1!1s0x89d4d5c824f03db7:0x6801054f8397d225?sa=X&ved=1t:242&ictx=111)for
  the Google Maps location.\n\n***\n\n## 🥪 Lunch Break\n\nWe'll stop in 
 a beautiful park for approximately **30 minutes**.\nBring your own lunch\,
  snacks\, and if you'd like\, something small to share with the group.\n\n
 ***\n\n## 🚆 Heading Home\n\nWe'll begin making our way back toward Toro
 nto at approximately **2:00 PM**.\n\n***\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 
 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **[mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:
 mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**\nThis fee helps support the group and allows 
 us to continue organizing events like this. Thank you for supporting commu
 nity! 💖\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Comfortable
  walking shoes\n🥪 Lunch or snacks\n🍎 Something to share (optional)\n
 ☀️ Sunscreen and a hat on warmer days\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This Fo
 r?\n\nThis group is open to anyone who wants to be social and make friends
 —whether single or not.\n\nWe also host:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hike
 s\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n🍽️ Restaurant gatherings\n\nThere's a
 lways something happening.\n\n***\n\n**REMEMBER:** You're welcome to just 
 show up on the day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nSometimes things
  happen and events may need to be cancelled\, so please keep an eye on upd
 ates.\n\n***\n\n👤 **Organizer:** Mathew\nQuestions? Post on the event w
 all or email\n📧 **[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontom
 oviesandoutings@hotmail.com)**\n\n**Come for the trails.**\n**Stay for the
  charming Main Street.**\n**Leave wondering why you don't visit Unionville
  more often.** 🌳🏘️✨
