SUMMARY:🌿🚶‍♂️ YORK BELTLINE TRAIL EVENING WALK & PUB NIGHT 
 🍻🌿
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🌿
 🚶‍♂️ YORK BELTLINE TRAIL EVENING WALK & PUB NIGHT 🍻🌿\n\n**A
  Hidden Urban Trail\, Easy Walking & A Relaxing Summer Evening**\n\nLookin
 g for an easy way to get outside after work?\n\nJoin us for a summer eveni
 ng walk along the York Beltline Trail\, one of Toronto's hidden green corr
 idors.\n\nBuilt on the route of the historic Belt Line Railway\, this peac
 eful trail offers a surprising escape from the city\, with mature trees\, 
 birdsong\, and plenty of shade—all just steps from the subway.\nThis is 
 an easy\, mostly flat walk with no major hills\, making it perfect for any
 one who wants to stretch their legs\, enjoy some fresh air\, and meet new 
 people.\n\nAfter our walk\, we'll head over to **The Bull: A Firkin Pub** 
 for dinner and a chance to relax\, chat\, and get to know one another. Aft
 er all\, the walk is just the beginning—the conversations afterward are 
 where friendships often start.\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click
  here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\
 n## 🚶‍♂️ What We'll Do\n\nWe'll spend about **90 minutes** walkin
 g the York Beltline Trail at a comfortable social pace.\nAlong the way we'
 ll enjoy one of Toronto's lesser-known walking trails\, share some convers
 ation\, and unwind after the workday.\n\nWhen we finish\, anyone who would
  like to is welcome to join us for dinner at **The Bull: A Firkin Pub**. Y
 ou're also welcome to head home after the walk if you prefer.\n\n***\n\n##
  ☀️ Weather & Expectations\n\nThis walk happens rain or shine unless s
 evere weather makes it unsafe.\nThe trail is mostly flat and suitable for 
 most fitness levels. Please wear comfortable walking shoes and bring water
  if it's a warm evening.\n\nThis is a **social walk**\, not a guided histo
 rical tour. I'll share a little history about the Beltline along the way\,
  but the focus is on enjoying the evening together.\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meet
 up Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:** Outside **Caledonia Station (North
  Entrance)**\n🫎 I'll be wearing my Moose Hat.\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** **6
 :30 PM**\n\nI will only wait **5 minutes.**\nEarly is on time.\nOn time is
  late.\nPlease be on time\, as we will leave promptly.\n\n🏁 **End Point
 :** Near Davisville Station.\n\n***\n\n## 🍽️ After the Walk\n\nWe'll 
 head to **The Bull: A Firkin Pub** for dinner and conversation.\n\n**Menu:
 ** [Click Here!](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thebullandfirkin/menus/)\n\n**
 *\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **
 [mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**\n\nThis fe
 e helps support the group and allows us to continue organizing events like
  this. Thank you for supporting community! 💖\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to 
 Bring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Comfortable walking shoes\n🍽️ Money if you'
 d like to join us for dinner afterward.\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?
 \n\nThis group is open to anyone who wants to be social and make friends
 —whether single or not.\n\nWe also host:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hike
 s\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n🍽️ Restaurant gatherings\nThere's alw
 ays something happening.\n\n***\n\n**REMEMBER:** You're welcome to just sh
 ow up on the day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nSometimes things h
 appen and events may need to be cancelled—please keep an eye on updates.
 \n\n***\n\n👤 **Organizer:** Mathew\nQuestions? Post on the event wall o
 r email:\n📧 **[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomovie
 sandoutings@hotmail.com)**\n\n**Come for the trail.**\n**Stay for the conv
 ersation.**\n\n**Leave wondering how one of Toronto's oldest railway lines
  became one of its best hidden walks.** 🌿🚶‍♂️🍻
